      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "削除されたノートの復元",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bcfb93ee5060d20dca17d256_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Deleted notes are listed in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Deleted Notes__TRILIUM_PH_1__ dialog (__TRILIUM_PH_2__Global menu__TRILIUM_PH_3__ → __TRILIUM_PH_4__Deleted notes__TRILIUM_PH_5__) and can be restored by pressing the __TRILIUM_PH_6__undelete__TRILIUM_PH_7__ link.",
      "sourceHash": "bcfb93ee5060d20dca17d2562db84b51cff08d4003cce0b93d6249ae5db30570",
      "context": "Restoring Deleted Notes",
      "contextHash": "c7ce8fd01a25486633065f68aa202adfe6e8b0d981b4642e35167f6edefbfc3f",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "削除されたノートは __TRILIUM_PH_0__Deleted Notes__TRILIUM_PH_1__ ダイアログ（__TRILIUM_PH_2__Global menu__TRILIUM_PH_3__ → __TRILIUM_PH_4__Deleted notes__TRILIUM_PH_5__）に一覧表示され、__TRILIUM_PH_6__undelete__TRILIUM_PH_7__ リンクを押すことで復元できます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8766112197502dc83ea0c03a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If a note has child notes, they will be restored along with it. Should the original location no longer exist (e.g. the parent has been deleted), the note will be restored into the default location for new notes (__TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Inbox__TRILIUM_PH_1__).",
      "sourceHash": "8766112197502dc83ea0c03a86ae6d289f007fc068d6bf09922802344bd12076",
      "context": "Restoring Deleted Notes",
      "contextHash": "c7ce8fd01a25486633065f68aa202adfe6e8b0d981b4642e35167f6edefbfc3f",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "ノートに子ノートがある場合、それらも一緒に復元されます。元の場所がすでに存在しない場合（親ノートが削除されている場合など）、ノートは新規ノートのデフォルトの場所（__TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Inbox__TRILIUM_PH_1__）に復元されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3a8afb98f952fdb5bca86bca_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When a note is hoisted in the tree, the dialog will only display notes deleted from the subtree of that hoisted note.",
      "sourceHash": "3a8afb98f952fdb5bca86bcaa0653be48f408778060d82b5b730f229b0ad3816",
      "context": "Restoring Deleted Notes",
      "contextHash": "c7ce8fd01a25486633065f68aa202adfe6e8b0d981b4642e35167f6edefbfc3f",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "ノートツリーでノートがホイストされている場合、ダイアログにはそのホイストされたノートのサブツリーから削除されたノートのみが表示されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_43b14292c2803afacc3f3274_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To permanently erase deleted notes and clear the list, press the three-dots menu and select __TRILIUM_PH_0__Erase deleted notes now__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "43b14292c2803afacc3f3274f586bb028deba42c7082de804d9b32b279e2a1e0",
      "context": "Restoring Deleted Notes",
      "contextHash": "c7ce8fd01a25486633065f68aa202adfe6e8b0d981b4642e35167f6edefbfc3f",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "削除されたノートを完全に消去してリストをクリアするには、三点リーダーメニューを押して __TRILIUM_PH_0__Erase deleted notes now__TRILIUM_PH_1__ を選択します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7de3e4305f065289d8cf03b0_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Deleted notes are permanently erased after a certain amount of time (7 days by default). To change this interval, press the three-dots menu and select __TRILIUM_PH_0__Deleted Notes Settings__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "7de3e4305f065289d8cf03b051a72986639a1d37e0f625ed9ad683df28c84b4a",
      "context": "Restoring Deleted Notes",
      "contextHash": "c7ce8fd01a25486633065f68aa202adfe6e8b0d981b4642e35167f6edefbfc3f",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "削除されたノートは、一定期間（デフォルトでは7日間）が経過すると完全に消去されます。この間隔を変更するには、三点リーダーメニューを押して __TRILIUM_PH_0__Deleted Notes Settings__TRILIUM_PH_1__ を選択します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    }
